WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.569
Diagrams, charts and code pictures from plain text.

2
00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:11.222
Write a flowchart in three lines, paste a table for a chart, and turn code

3
00:00:11.222 --> 00:00:16.306
into a clean picture. Plus blobs, waves and printable graph paper, all in

4
00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:17.141
the browser.

5
00:00:18.541 --> 00:00:23.277
Diagrams with Mermaid. Mermaid is a small language for diagrams.

6
00:00:24.577 --> 00:00:29.399
Charts from a pasted table. Chart Maker takes data straight from a spreadsheet.

7
00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:35.960
Shapes and paper. Blob and Wave Generator makes organic blobs, layered section

8
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.781
waves and scattered shapes.

9
00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:44.447
Why text first works. Writing a picture as text sounds odd until you try

10
00:00:44.447 --> 00:00:44.671
it.

11
00:00:45.971 --> 00:00:49.742
To try it, open Diagram Maker (Mermaid) in OpenFile.

12
00:00:49.742 --> 00:00:53.877
Drop in a file, adjust the settings and press the button.

13
00:00:53.877 --> 00:00:57.576
It all runs on your device, so nothing is uploaded.

14
00:00:59.276 --> 00:01:03.713
Read the full post, with live demos, on the OpenFile blog.
